[{"ave_id":"AVE-2009-0027","file_name":"2009/AVE-2009-0027.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2009-2197","title":"Apple Safari 界面欺骗漏洞","description":"通过精心构建的网页，攻击者可以欺骗 Safari 浏览器将用户可控的文本意外地显示在系统对话框中，导致 UI 伪造漏洞。攻击无需身份验证，只需用户访问恶意网站即可触发。攻击在 Safari 9.1 版本及更早版本中尤为严重，影响所有运行 Safari 的苹果设备，包括台式机和移动设备。该漏洞可能被攻击者用于实施网络钓鱼欺骗、诱导用户点击恶意按钮或输入敏感信息，甚至可能被用于其他安全敏感操作，危及用户信息安全。Microsoft 虽未发布官方补丁，但用户应升级到 Safari 9.1 或更高版本以获得修复。CVSS 评分 4.3，中等威胁级别，主要影响信息欺骗领域。支持网站利用该漏洞实现社交工程攻击，尤其针对点击劫持和用户欺骗场景。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2009-2197"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2016-03-24T01:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:08:59Z","remediation":"立即升级 Safari 至 9.1 或更高版本（随 OS X El Capitan 10.11.1 / iOS 9.1 发布）。无法立即升级时，可暂时禁用 JavaScript 或改用 Chrome/Firefox 等替代浏览器，并警惕弹出对话框中的异常文本，避免误点确认。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2016/Mar/msg00005.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/85055","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1035354","https://support.apple.com/HT206171","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2009/2xxx/CVE-2009-2197.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2009/CVE-2009-2197","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2009-2197.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2009/CVE-2009-2197.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-h555-7qwc-mr94/GHSA-h555-7qwc-mr94.json","https://github.com/we1h0/SecurityManageFramwork/blob/e706461bdf5e2bc78e9fc59c66904b95e81e331e/cnvd_xml/2016-03-21_2016-03-27.xml","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_75100_75200.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2009/CVE-2009-2197.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ae123e3b-46de-491e-afaf-ae4a242c6458.json","https://github.com/sailuh/perceive/blob/85ca622832e25fa91d8d836b8c93a096178bb35d/Notebooks/NVD/data/2009.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2009/AVE-2009-0027.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2009-0017","file_name":"2009/AVE-2009-0017.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2009-5114","title":"WebGlimpse wgarcmin.cgi 目录遍历漏洞","description":"WebGlimpse 2.18.7 及更早版本中的 wgarcmin.cgi 脚本存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 DOC 参数传递包含 `..`（点点）序列的特制请求，利用路径回溯技术突破目录限制，读取服务器上任意文件，包括敏感配置文件、密码文件等。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2009-5114"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-03-19T18:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:15:06Z","remediation":"升级 WebGlimpse 至 2.19.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 wgarcmin.cgi 中 DOC 参数的目录遍历漏洞。若厂商已停止维护，建议迁移至其他活跃维护的搜索工具（如 Apache Solr、Elasticsearch），并在 Web 服务器层配置输入过滤规则，拦截包含 `../` 等路径遍历特征的请求。同时确保 wgarcmin.cgi 脚本对 DOC 参数做路径规范化检查，拒绝非授权路径访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://websecurity.com.ua/2628/","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/74321","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36994","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2009/CVE-2009-5114.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2009/CVE-2009-5114.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1482f62c613998b0fe0690591034b732c0bb2e0a/http/cves/2009/CVE-2009-5114.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/de9949dedbd4d7d071222d7c816d86aa68e1eb86/cves/2009/5xxx/CVE-2009-5114.json","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/5001-to-6000-templates/cve-2009-5114-1483.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2009-5114.js","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2009-5114_38.yaml","https://github.com/CriticalMatterial/NucleiTemplates/blob/2c4c9867bfbda69385d06f819577cbb7b35758e1/cves/2009/CVE-2009-5114.yaml","https://github.com/amad3us47/amad3us47.github.io/blob/07cfc0edf465277028554b47198f6f186d3215b6/data/cve-2009-5114-1481.yaml","https://github.com/w4n95/vuls-data-raw-exploit-inthewild/blob/2c8c2568a21a9cc77244882f65c37bca47d71613/2009/CVE-2009-5114.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/f2d12f176efdb99f18928b2678d34b7fa4f530f8/content/CVE-2009-5114.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2009/AVE-2009-0017.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2009-0060","file_name":"2009/AVE-2009-0060.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2009-5078","title":"GNU troff 设计错误导致任意文件操作漏洞","description":"GNU troff (groff) 1.21 之前版本中 contrib/pdfmark/pdfroff.sh 脚本存在设计缺陷，在调用 Ghostscript 程序处理文档时未添加 -dSAFER 安全选项，导致远程攻击者可通过构造恶意文档，利用 Ghostscript 的功能创建、覆盖、重命名或删除任意文件。该漏洞影响 groff 1.21 之前版本，CVSS 3.0 评分 6.5 (MEDIUM)，攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需权限和用户交互，成功利用可导致文件完整性和可用性受损。GNU 已在 groff 1.21 版本中修复该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2009-5078"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-06-30T15:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:14:57Z","remediation":"建议升级 GNU troff (groff) 至 1.21 或更高版本，该版本已在 pdfroff.sh 中添加 -dSAFER 参数限制 Ghostscript 权限。若无法立即升级，可手动编辑 contrib/pdfmark/pdfroff.sh 脚本，在 gs 命令行参数中添加 -dSAFER 选项以限制文件系统访问权限。Gentoo 用户可执行 emerge --ask '>=sys-text/groff-1.21' 升级，Debian/Ubuntu 用户可执行 apt-get update && apt-get install groff 升级至修复版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=538338","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2015/Aug/msg00001.html","http://openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2009/08/09/1","http://openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2009/08/10/2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/36381","https://support.apple.com/kb/HT205031","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2009/5xxx/CVE-2009-5078.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2009/CVE-2009-5078","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2009-5078.md","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2009-5078","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-pg77-m46r-9ph2/GHSA-pg77-m46r-9ph2.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2009-5078.json","https://github.com/gentoo-mirror/gentoo/blob/ae2207ad288645b96f6512ac7522b446102592d5/metadata/glsa/glsa-201310-14.xml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/3b63910ae4e1e9b72167345f63d9f5750b50ec5a/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2009-5078","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/G/gentoo_GLSA-201310-14.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_107400_107500.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2009/AVE-2009-0060.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2009-0059","file_name":"2009/AVE-2009-0059.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2009-5044","title":"GNU troff 后置链接文件覆盖漏洞","description":"GNU Troff (groff) 1.21 版本前的 contrib/pdfmark/pdfroff.sh 脚本存在符号链接攻击漏洞。该脚本在创建临时文件 pdf#####.tmp 时未进行安全检查，本地攻击者可预先创建同名符号链接指向任意目标文件，当脚本以更高权限写入临时文件时，实际会覆盖链接指向的任意文件。攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，利用竞争条件在脚本创建临时文件前建立恶意符号链接，可导致任意文件被覆盖，影响文件完整性和可用性。受影响版本为 groff 1.21 之前版本，升级至 1.21 或更高版本可修复此漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":3.3,"aliases":["CVE-2009-5044"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-06-24T20:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:14:53Z","remediation":"升级 GNU groff 到 1.21 或更高版本（如 `sudo apt-get update && sudo apt-get install groff=1.22.4-3`），或应用厂商补丁（如 Pardus 的 groff-cve-2009-5044_5080_5081.patch），临时缓解可设置 `TMPDIR` 指向私有目录并限制 `/tmp` 权限为 1777 防止符号链接攻击","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=538330","http://cvsweb.openwall.com/cgi/cvsweb.cgi/Owl/packages/groff/groff-1.20.1-owl-tmp.diff","http://cvsweb.openwall.com/cgi/cvsweb.cgi/Owl/packages/groff/groff-1.20.1-owl-tmp.diff.diff?r1=1.1%3Br2=1.2%3Bf=h","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2015/Aug/msg00001.html","http://openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2009/08/09/1","http://openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2009/08/10/2","http://openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2009/08/14/4","http://openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2009/08/14/5","http://secunia.com/advisories/44999","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2013:085","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2013:086","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/36381","https://support.apple.com/kb/HT205031","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2009/5xxx/CVE-2009-5044.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2009/CVE-2009-5044","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/c984df92c20d7e1001c689aa8eb62512e9223ea6/specs/g/groff/groff.spec","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/3bd1bd6e15d7a361230990a418fdbc924d1d9ca2/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2009-5044.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2009-5044.md","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2009-5044","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2009/CVE-2009-5044.json","https://github.com/Stichting-MINIX-Research-Foundation/pkgsrc-ng/blob/7cb8e5b41bc96d1cb281a09cba18177ed82c51b7/textproc/groff/patches/patch-gendef.sh","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2015/glsa-201310-14.nasl","https://github.com/pardus-anka/anka-stable/blob/69b792175f60a906c34169d291ffa459a113bebc/2013/system/base/groff/files/groff-cve-2009-5044_5080_5081.patch"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2009/AVE-2009-0059.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2009-0016","file_name":"2009/AVE-2009-0016.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2009-5020","title":"AWStats awredir.pl 开放重定向漏洞","description":"AWStats 6.95 之前版本中的 awredir.pl 脚本存在开放重定向漏洞（CWE-20：输入验证不当）。远程攻击者可通过特制请求，利用该漏洞将用户重定向至任意恶意网站，进而实施钓鱼攻击窃取敏感信息。攻击者无需身份认证即可发起攻击，但需诱使用户点击恶意链接，CVSS 评分 5.8，危害等级中。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.8,"aliases":["CVE-2009-5020"],"sources":["cve","nuclei"],"published":"2010-12-02T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 AWStats 至 6.95 或更高版本以修复 awredir.pl 中的开放重定向漏洞。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器层面对 awredir.pl 脚本的访问添加 URL 白名单校验规则，限制重定向目标仅为受信任域名。同时检查 Web 日志中是否存在利用该漏洞的异常重定向请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://awstats.sourceforge.net/docs/awstats_changelog.txt","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2009/CVE-2009-5020.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2009/CVE-2009-5020.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/de9949dedbd4d7d071222d7c816d86aa68e1eb86/cves/2009/5xxx/CVE-2009-5020.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/f29605a96fd1261602d83e1b34d001cc853a7340/nvdcve/CVE-2009-5020.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2009/AVE-2009-0016.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2009-0015","file_name":"2009/AVE-2009-0015.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2009-4679","title":"Joomla! iF Portfolio Nexus 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 iF Portfolio Nexus (com_if_nexus) 组件 1.5 版本存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 index.php 传递包含 `..` 序列的 controller 参数触发该漏洞，实现任意本地文件的包含与执行，可能导致敏感信息泄露或远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Joomla! 中使用该组件的网站，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2009-4679"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2010-03-08T15:30:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:14:09Z","remediation":"立即卸载或禁用 Joomla! 的 com_if_nexus 组件（版本 1.5），此组件已停止维护且不再有官方补丁。作为临时缓解，可修改 index.php 对 controller 参数进行严格过滤，拒绝包含 `..` 的路径字符串，或删除该组件目录彻底消除风险。建议迁移至其他仍在维护的 Joomla! 图库组件替代 iF Portfolio Nexus。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/37760","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/10754","http://www.osvdb.org/61382","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/37473","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/33440","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2009/CVE-2009-4679.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2009/CVE-2009-4679.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1482f62c613998b0fe0690591034b732c0bb2e0a/http/cves/2009/CVE-2009-4679.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/de9949dedbd4d7d071222d7c816d86aa68e1eb86/cves/2009/4xxx/CVE-2009-4679.json","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/5001-to-6000-templates/cve-2009-4679-1476.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2009/CVE-2009-4679.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2009-4679_31.yaml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/32d2bf74aba181d7e166ecf9becdff3983874bd2/CVE-2009/CVE-2009-46xx/CVE-2009-4679.json","https://github.com/ahisec/Lots-of-POC/blob/51ed84ccc21e97e5e12563150992e03f9de384cd/nuclei/inertialfate/com_if_nexus/CVE-2009-4679.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2009-4679-1472.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/cve-2009-4679-1472.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2009/AVE-2009-0015.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2009-0047","file_name":"2009/AVE-2009-0047.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2009-3988","title":"Mozilla Firefox 与 SeaMonkey showModalDialog 同源策略绕过跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 3.0.x（3.0.18之前）和3.5.x（3.5.8之前）以及 SeaMonkey 2.0.3 之前的版本中，showModalDialog 方法存在安全绕过漏洞。攻击者可通过构造恶意的 dialogArguments 参数，在跨域对话框中读取目标文档的对象属性，从而绕过同源策略限制。该漏洞允许远程攻击者在受害者的浏览器上以目标站点的权限执行跨站脚本（XSS）攻击，窃取用户会话令牌或钓鱼凭证。攻击条件为：受害者需访问包含恶意代码的页面并调用 showModalDialog 打开跨域对话框，受害者浏览器需运行受影响的 Firefox 或 SeaMonkey 版本。漏洞危害等级中等，CVSS 评分为 5.0。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2009-3988"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-02-22T13:00:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:12:46Z","remediation":"立即将 Mozilla Firefox 升级至 3.0.18 或 3.5.8 及以上版本，将 SeaMonkey 升级至 2.0.3 及以上版本以修复 showModalDialog 同源策略绕过漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器配置中禁用 JavaScript 的 dialogArguments 传递功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2010-February/035346.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2010-February/035367.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2010-February/035426.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2010-03/msg00001.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/37242","http://secunia.com/advisories/38847","http://www.debian.org/security/2010/dsa-1999","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2010:042","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2010/mfsa2010-04.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2010-0112.html","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-895-1","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-896-1","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/0405","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=504862","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/56362","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A8355","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A9384","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2009/CVE-2009-3988.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/af9951ed676bcfbcd0689aad53e974095f78dc27/cves/2009/3xxx/CVE-2009-3988.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2009/CVE-2009-3988","https://github.com/mozilla/foundation-security-advisories/blob/3b3c634b70342ed22f06614c696b3ad8867239e1/announce/2010/mfsa2010-04.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2009.txt","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2009-3988","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9f14dd7a1c5691895422a824762c1dbc0caf1d9a/CVE/data/2009/CVE-2009-3988.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/gb_CESA-2010_0112_firefox_centos5_i386.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/D/debian_DSA-1999.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2009-3988.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2009/AVE-2009-0047.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2009-0025","file_name":"2009/AVE-2009-0025.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2009-1571","title":"Mozilla Firefox HTML解析器释放后使用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"这是一个使用于 Mozilla Firefox、Thunderbird 和 SeaMonkey 等 Mozilla 产品的 HTML 解析器中的使用后释放漏洞。攻击者可以构造包含恶意 HTML 内容的网页，当浏览器解析此类网页时，会由于内存不足导致 HTML 解析器错误地释放仍在使用的内存对象。随后攻击者控制的文本可以覆写这些被释放的内存区域，当相关方法被调用时，就可能导致这些被覆写的内存对象执行攻击者提供的任意代码。该漏洞影响Firefox 3.0.x版本低于3.0.18及3.5.x版本低于3.5.8的用户，以及Thunderbird低于3.0.2及SeaMonkey低于2.0.3的用户。CVSS评分10.0，危险程度极高，可通过简单的网络攻击实现远程代码执行。Mozilla 在发布Firefox 3.5.8版本时对此漏洞进行了修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2009-1571"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-02-22T13:00:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:07:32Z","remediation":"立即升级 Firefox 3.0.x 至 3.0.18 或更高版本，或升级 Firefox 3.5.x 至 3.5.8 或更高版本；Thunderbird 用户升级至 3.0.2 及以上；SeaMonkey 用户升级至 2.0.3 及以上。临时缓解：在 Firefox 中禁用 JavaScript（工具→选项→内容→取消勾选\"启用 JavaScript\"），或安装 NoScript 扩展禁用非信任站点脚本执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2010-February/035346.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2010-February/035367.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2010-February/035426.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2010-March/036097.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2010-March/036132.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2010-03/msg00001.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/37242","http://secunia.com/advisories/38770","http://secunia.com/advisories/38772","http://secunia.com/advisories/38847","http://secunia.com/secunia_research/2009-45/","http://www.debian.org/security/2010/dsa-1999","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2010:042","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2010:051","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2010/mfsa2010-03.html","http://www.redha