"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2009/AVE-2009-0025.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2009-0037","file_name":"2009/AVE-2009-0037.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2009-3302","title":"Apache OpenOffice Word 文档处理远程代码执行漏洞","description":"OpenOffice.org 3.2 之前版本的 filter/ww8/ww8par2.cxx 文件在处理 Word 文档中的 sprmTSetBrc 表格属性修饰符时存在边界错误漏洞。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户打开精心构造的恶意 Word 文档，触发边界错误导致应用程序崩溃（拒绝服务）或可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 OpenOffice.org 3.2 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 9.3（CVSS:AV:N/AC:M/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），属于严重级别代码执行漏洞（CWE-94）。攻击者无需认证即可通过网络远程攻击，需要用户交互打开恶意文档。OpenOffice.org 3.2 版本已修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至 3.2 或更高版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2009-3302"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-02-16T19:30:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:11:20Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 OpenOffice.org 至 3.2 或更高版本（如 Apache OpenOffice 4.x 或 LibreOffice 7.x 等维护分支）。从官网 https://www.openoffice.org/download/ 下载对应平台安装包并覆盖安装。若暂时无法升级，请暂停使用受影响版本打开来源不明的 Microsoft Word 文档，并部署文档杀毒/沙箱隔离作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2010-03/msg00005.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/38567","http://secunia.com/advisories/38568","http://secunia.com/advisories/38695","http://secunia.com/advisories/38921","http://secunia.com/advisories/41818","http://secunia.com/advisories/60799","http://securitytracker.com/id?1023591","http://www.debian.org/security/2010/dsa-1995","http://www.gentoo.org/security/en/glsa/glsa-201408-19.xml","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2010:221","http://www.openoffice.org/security/bulletin.html","http://www.openoffice.org/security/cves/CVE-2009-3301-3302.html","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/cpuoct2010-175626.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2010-0101.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/38218","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-903-1","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA