:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:10:33Z","remediation":"立即升级OpenOffice到3.2或更高版本，该版本修复了libxml2、libxmlsec等库的安全漏洞，并增强了GIF文件处理的安全校验。如果无法立即升级，可暂时禁用Office的GIF预览功能，并通过集团防火墙过滤 \"*.gif\" 类型的文件entrada sospechosa，降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2010-03/msg00005.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/38567","http://secunia.com/advisories/38568","http://secunia.com/advisories/38695","http://secunia.com/advisories/38921","http://secunia.com/advisories/41818","http://secunia.com/advisories/60799","http://securitytracker.com/id?1023591","http://www.debian.org/security/2010/dsa-1995","http://www.gentoo.org/security/en/glsa/glsa-201408-19.xml","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2010:221","http://www.openoffice.org/security/bulletin.html","http://www.openoffice.org/security/cves/CVE-2009-2950.html","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/cpuoct2010-175626.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2010-0101.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/38218","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-903-1","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA10-287A.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/0366","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/0635","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/2905","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=527512","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/56238","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A11050","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2009/CVE-2009-2950.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3dd627d6b90f81690ae15e5d5fb02176cc79caf3/cves/2009/2xxx/CVE-2009-2950.json","https://github.com/mudongliang/LinuxFlaw/blob/7738b4e61bddf979fe10215125da19bcb99d2318/CVE-2009-2950/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2009/CVE-2009-2950","https://github.com/SunStarSys/orion/blob/845dc4a772afcfef0a471ab5dd3dbc00f5e99397/ooo-trunk/content/security/cves/CVE-2009-2950.html","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2009.txt","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2009-2950","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/feabd62c1cd6ce9619141f482e05a247e5f24802/2009/CVE-2009-2950.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-jc5p-6484-2396/GHSA-jc5p-6484-2396.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2009/CVE-2009-2950.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2009/AVE-2009-0035.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2009-0034","file_name":"2009/AVE-2009-0034.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2009-2949","title":"OpenOffice.org XPM 文件整数溢出堆缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"OpenOffice.org XPMReader::ReadXPM 函数存在整数溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过诱导用户打开精心构造的恶意 XPM 图像文件，触发堆缓冲区溢出实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 OpenOffice.org 3.2 及之前版本，攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度中等，无需身份认证即可利用，成功利用可导致完全的机密性、完整性和可用性丧失（CVSS 9.3，CVSS:3.0/AV:N/AC:M/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H）。攻击者需诱导受害者打开恶意 XPM 文件，触发 XPMReader::ReadXPM 函数中的整数溢出导致堆缓冲区溢出，进而在用户上下文中执行任意代码。OpenOffice.org 3.2 版本已修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2009-2949"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-02-16T19:30:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:10:33Z","remediation":"立即升级 OpenOffice 到 3.2 或更高版本，应用 Apache 2010 年 8 月安全更新或直接更新到 3.2.1。此前版本存在多项安全问题，需一次性修复所有漏洞。如无法立即更新，可在 OpenOffice 配置中禁用 XPM 文件预览功能以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2010-03/msg00005.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/38567","http://secunia.com/advisories/38568","http://secunia.com/advisories/38695","